South Devon MP [Caroline Voaden](https://www.carolinevoaden.com) is on a summer surgery tour, visiting over 50 communities around the constituency.

Her tour brings her to **Meadowbrook on Wednesday 19 August, between 9am and 9.30am**. Residents are invited to come along to have a quick chat or to discuss issues affecting them.

Please note that for safety reasons security personnel will be present. Meetings are first come, first served, and time will be limited.

---

Can't make this one? The full list of tour dates and locations is on [carolinevoaden.com](https://www.carolinevoaden.com), or you can get in touch with the office directly:

- Telephone: 01803 658461
- Email: [caroline.voaden.mp@parliament.uk](mailto:caroline.voaden.mp@parliament.uk)
